              <p class="reveal d2">
                The best nature apps don't trap children behind a screen; they awaken a sense of wonder for real animals,
                plants, and ecosystems that carries over into your next walk in the woods. Here are the 7 best indoor
                and outdoor nature apps for curious kids.
              </p>

              <div class="simple-gallery reveal">
                <img src="/images/guides/guides_3.jpeg" class="landscape"
